  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "わざを　つかった　２ターン　あとに\nあいてに　ねんりきの\nかたまりを　おくって　こうげきする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "기술을 사용한 2턴 뒤에\n상대에게 염동력의\n덩어리를 보내어 공격한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用招式的２回合後，\n向對手發送一團念力進行攻擊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "De l’énergie psychique vient frapper l’ennemi\ndeux tours après l’utilisation de cette capacité.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zwei Runden, nachdem Seher eingesetzt wurde,\nerfolgt ein Angriff mit Psycho-Energie.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Concentra energía psíquica para golpear al objetivo dos\nturnos después.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Due turni dopo l’utilizzo di questa mossa,\nil bersaglio viene attaccato con energia psichica.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two turns after this move is used, a hunk of psychic\nenergy attacks the target.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "技を　使った　２ターン後に\n相手に　念力の\n塊を　送って　攻撃する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在使用招式２回合后，\n向对手发送一团念力进行攻击。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
